            <div xml:id="d426">

                <pb facs="0413" n="331" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg331"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 895.00/535.</note>
                <head>[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-02-06"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The minister for foreign affairs has confirmed satisfactorily what he had
                    expressed in conversation concerning consular registration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">O’Brien.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
